## CSMS Project RACI Matrix (Summary)

| Activity | CISO/Security Lead | PM | Engineering | Procurement | Top Management |
|----------|-------------------|----|--------------|----|----------------|
| Gap Analysis | A | R | C | I | I |
| Policy Development | A | R | C | I | A |
| TARA | R | A | R | I | I |
| Supplier Mgmt | C | A | I | R | I |
| Internal Audit | R | A | C | I | I |
| Management Review | C | R | I | I | A |
| Technical Service | C | R | R | I | I |

*R = Responsible, A = Accountable, C = Consulted, I = Informed*

